0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12013","armor":"WP1002905","helmet":"WP1021805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10011","city":"CS1005","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[72,67,32,45,67,69],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"550","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12013","armor":"WP1002905","helmet":"WP1021805"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"蜀国武将。刘备率大军伐吴时，与冯习、吴班一同进攻孙桓，并将其困于彝陵城。蜀军因火烧连营而败退时，又与冯习等人去救援刘备，并于途中与冯习战死在乱军之中。","tc":"蜀國武將。劉備率大軍伐吳時，與馮習、吳班一同進攻孫桓，并將其困于彝陵城。蜀軍因火燒連營而敗退時，又與馮習等人去救援劉備，并于途中與馮習戰死在亂軍之中。","en":"A military officer of Shu. When Liu Bei led a massive expedition against Wu, he advanced alongside Feng Xi and Wu Ban to besiege Sun Huan at Yiling. When the Shu army was routed by the devastating fire attack on its linked camps, he joined Feng Xi in rushing to rescue Liu Bei but was killed along with Feng Xi during the chaotic retreat.","jp":"蜀の武将。劉備が大軍を率いて呉を討伐した際、馮習や呉班とともに孫桓を攻め、彝陵城に包囲した。蜀軍が火攻めで連営を焼かれて敗退すると、馮習らとともに劉備の救援に向かったが、その途中で馮習とともに乱戦の中で戦死した。","kr":"촉나라의 무장. 유비가 대군을 이끌고 오나라를 정벌할 때 풍습, 오반과 함께 손환을 공격하여 이릉성에 고립시켰다. 촉군이 화소연영으로 패퇴하자 다시 풍습 등과 함께 유비를 구원하러 나섰으나, 도중 난군 속에서 풍습과 함께 전사했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10512","remark":"","surname":"张","surnameTc":"張","surnameEn":"Zhang","surnameJp":"張","surnameKr":"장","surnameOther":"","name":"南","nameTc":"南","nameEn":"Nan","nameJp":"南","nameKr":"남","nameOther":"","word":"文进","wordTc":"文進","wordEn":"Wenjin","wordJp":"文進","wordKr":"문진","wordOther":"","icon":"张南","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"209","city":"CS1016","gender":"0","rule":"72","force":"67","wise":"32","politics":"45","charm":"67","will":"69","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"7","wiseTalent":"2",